      <h2 style="font-size:24px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:6px;">🎁 Gift Shop</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px;opacity:.9;">WCCoin တွေနဲ့ လက်ဆောင်ပစ္စည်းတွေ လဲလှယ်ပါ</p>
      <div style="font-size:28px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"><div class="coin-icon" style="width:24px;height:24px;"></div><span id="giftBalance">0</span> WCCoin</div>
